guide forever/class/druid/cat-form
title Cat Form
category Class
folder Druid
keywords Cat Form, The Great Cat Spirit, The Great Windborne Cat Spirit, Avatar of Saeyleenan, Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit, Stormrage Barrow Dens, Relic of the Fang, Relic of the Claw, Relic of the Silent Shadow, Moonglade, Skyborne, class quest
reward spell 768 "Cat Form"
why Your stealth and melee form: in Forever this chain gives Cat Form at 20, not the trainer.
class Druid
levels 20-22
zone Moonglade

# Cat Form, Forever-new at level 20 (Forever's druid class quest list lists
# the chain as new): your trainer sends you to Dendrite Starblaze in
# Moonglade, who sends you to the Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves, Tauren) or
# the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne, the Windborne quests 98341, 98404,
# 98738); three relics from the Stormrage Barrow Dens, then back to Dendrite
# and your trainer.
# - Alliance: The Great Cat Spirit (98393, Mathrengyl Bearwalker) -> 98394,
#   98396, 98731 (Night Elves) or 98341, 98404, 98738 (Skyborne) -> To
#   Darnassus (98397).
# - Horde: The Great Cat Spirit (98340, Turak Runetotem) -> 98405, 98342,
#   98739 (Tauren) or 98341, 98404, 98738 (Skyborne) -> To Thunder Bluff
#   (98362).
# The leveling guides carry the chain inline (alliance/03-darkshore,
# horde/04-the-barrens): this guide is for druids off our route.
# Gotchas from Forever's quest notes: the Avatar stands on a hill, the
# statue's stealth runs out, the enraged spirits attack on sight, the Silent
# Shadow (two spawns) is camped, a relic another player is looting shows as
# unusable; the Skyborne hand-in is Dendrite, not Zephras Isle.
# Sources: quests.json (Questie 12.1.0, Forever) and the relic points and
# tips of the leveling guides above (from players' reports in the first
# weeks of the beta).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Alliance
# Mathrengyl stands upstairs in the druids' building and the walking maps have no way up inside it:
# without a waypoint the arrow led onto a ledge outside his floor, behind the wall (#1338). Each step
# to him comes after a goto at the building's door on its south side, 35.8,11.6, where players'
# recordings walk in; from there the arrow points straight at him.

step Cenarion Enclave
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne far from Darnassus: cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Aquatic Form yet? Take A Lesson to Learn from him too: it also goes to Dendrite, and its Trial of the Lake (the Aquatic Form guide) is in the same Moonglade.
  level 20
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Cenarion Enclave"

step The Great Cat Spirit
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne far from Darnassus: cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Aquatic Form yet? Take A Lesson to Learn from him too: it also goes to Dendrite, and its Trial of the Lake (the Aquatic Form guide) is in the same Moonglade.
  level 20
  accept 98393                          -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. Learn the flight path there if you do not have it.
  turnin 98393                          -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 98394 only NightElf
  accept 98341 only Skyborne
  getfp "Moonglade"

step The relics of the Barrow Dens
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) waits on the hill above the bridge in southern Moonglade; the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) stands on high ground past the twin bridges, south-west of Nighthaven: climb up to it. The relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens east of the lake: leave your form and click the statue at the den's entrance for a short stealth (five minutes), then go deep into the cave and over the bridge. Enraged spirits guard the relics and attack anything they see: stay in the statue's stealth and keep moving. Each relic is a small orb beside a cat statue in an alcove: the Fang and the Claw have one spot each, the Silent Shadow two, and it is the one players camp. A relic shows as unusable while another player loots it: wait a moment and try again. Stealth gone? Walk back to the entrance statue for more.
  turnin 98394 @54.5,75.0 only NightElf -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98396 @54.5,75.0 only NightElf
  turnin 98341 only Skyborne            -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98404 only Skyborne
  collect 280502 quest 98396.1 @72.4,66.0 only NightElf -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98396.2 @75.2,67.2 only NightElf -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98396.3 @74.4,65.4 only NightElf -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  collect 280502 quest 98404.1 @72.4,66.0 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98404.2 @75.2,67.2 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98404.3 @74.4,65.4 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  turnin 98396 @54.5,75.0 only NightElf -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98731 @54.5,75.0 only NightElf
  turnin 98404 only Skyborne            -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98738 only Skyborne

step Back to Dendrite
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade to land by Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven (nobody on Zephras Isle takes the Skyborne quest), then take Silva Fil'naveth's flight to Rut'theran Village: she stands in the middle of Nighthaven and flies druids there, no flight path needed. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 98731 only NightElf            -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 98738 only Skyborne
  accept 98397
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Cenarion Enclave
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to Mathrengyl, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave: he teaches you Cat Form.
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Cenarion Enclave"

step To Darnassus
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to Mathrengyl, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave: he teaches you Cat Form.
  turnin 98397                          -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cat Form

