step Back to Dendrite
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade to land by Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven (nobody on Zephras Isle takes the Skyborne quest), then take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
